{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46805","headline":"送刘秀才归桑水宁觐 · 齐己","name":"送刘秀才归桑水宁觐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"归和初喜戢戈矛，乍捧乡书感去留。\n雁序分飞离汉口，鴒原骞翥在鳌头。\n家邻紫塞仍千里，路过黄河更几州。\n应到高堂问安後，却携文入帝京游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}